# Docker build context for apps/web/Dockerfile and apps/cms/Dockerfile (both
# built from the repo root). Keep secrets and local state out of the image.
# Railway (Railpack) may read this file too, so it must not hide anything a
# normal `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile` needs (e.g. a workspace package).
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/dist
.git
.github-token
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
*.dump
apps/cms/media
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
